DESCRIPTION >
    Public model statistics computed once per hour by public_model_stats_refresh.

SCHEMA >
    `model` LowCardinality(String) `json:$.model`,
    `request_count` UInt64 `json:$.request_count`,
    `success_count` UInt64 `json:$.success_count`,
    `priced_success_count` UInt64 `json:$.priced_success_count`,
    `user_count` UInt64 `json:$.user_count`,
    `avg_cost_usd` Float64 `json:$.avg_cost_usd`,
    `avg_response_ms` Float64 `json:$.avg_response_ms`,
    `error_count` UInt64 `json:$.error_count`

ENGINE MergeTree
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY model
